#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Enable the following options in the kernel configuration and recompile the "
"kernel if necessary:"
msgstr ""
"Habilite as seguintes opções na configuração do núcleo e recompile o núcleo "
"se necessário:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Note that it is only needed for mounting NTFS partitions with ntfs-3g.  If "
"you will use the in-kernel NTFS3 driver for mounting NTFS partitions (as the"
" BLFS editors recommend) instead, you can skip this configuration item."
msgstr ""
"Observe que isso só é necessário para montar partições NTFS com ntfs-3g. Se,"
" ao invés, você usará o controlador NTFS3 intra núcleo para montar partições"
" NTFS (como os(as) editores(as) do BLFS recomendam), você pode ignorar esse "
"item de configuração."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:132
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Ntfs-3g"
msgstr "Instalação do Ntfs-3g"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:135
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Ntfs-3g</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>Ntfs-3g</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:139
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./autogen.sh &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"            --disable-static     \\\n"
"            --with-fuse=internal \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/ntfs-3g-&ntfs-3g-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./autogen.sh &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"            --disable-static     \\\n"
"            --with-fuse=internal \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/ntfs-3g-&ntfs-3g-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:152
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:155
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:158
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"It's recommended to use the in-kernel NTFS3 driver for mounting NTFS "
"filesystems, instead of ntfs-3g (see the note at the start of this page).  "
"However, if you want to use ntfs-3g to mount the NTFS filesystems anyway, "
"create a symlink for the <command>mount</command> command:"
msgstr ""
"É recomendável usar o controlador NTFS3 interno ao núcleo para montar "
"sistemas de arquivos NTFS, em vez do ntfs-3g (veja-se a observação no início"
" desta página). No entanto, se você quiser, de qualquer maneira, usar o "
"ntfs-3g para montar os sistemas de arquivos NTFS, [então] crie um link "
"simbólico para o comando <command>mount</command>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:165
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ln -svf ../bin/ntfs-3g /usr/sbin/mount.ntfs &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -svf ntfs-3g.8 /usr/share/man/man8/mount.ntfs.8</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ln -svf ../bin/ntfs-3g /usr/sbin/mount.ntfs &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -svf ntfs-3g.8 /usr/share/man/man8/mount.ntfs.8</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:171
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:177
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-fuse=internal</parameter>: This switch dynamically forces "
"<application>ntfs-3g</application> to use an internal copy of the "
"<application>fuse-2.x</application> library. This is required if you wish to"
" allow users to mount NTFS partitions."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-fuse=internal</parameter>: Essa chave força dinamicamente "
"o <application>ntfs-3g</application> a usar uma cópia interna da biblioteca "
"<application>fuse-2.x</application>. Isso é exigido se você deseja permitir "
"que os(as) usuários(as) montem partições NTFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:184
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-ntfsprogs</option>: Disables installation of various "
"utilities used to manipulate NTFS partitions."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-ntfsprogs</option>: Desabilita a instalação de vários "
"utilitários usados para manipular partições NTFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:189
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>chmod -v 4755 /usr/bin/ntfs-3g</command>: Making mount.ntfs setuid "
"root allows non root users to mount NTFS partitions."
msgstr ""
"<command>chmod -v 4755 /usr/bin/ntfs-3g</command>: Tornar mount.ntfs setuid "
"root permite que usuários(as) não root montem partições NTFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:196
#, xml-text
msgid "Using Ntfs-3g"
msgstr "Usando o Ntfs-3g"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:199
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To mount a Windows partition at boot time, put a line like this in "
"/etc/fstab:"
msgstr ""
"Para montar uma partição do Windows em tempo de inicialização, coloque uma "
"linha como esta em /etc/fstab:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:203
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "/dev/sda1 /mnt/windows auto defaults 0 0"
msgstr "/dev/sda1 /mnt/windows auto defaults 0 0"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:206
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To allow users to mount a usb stick with an NTFS filesystem on it, put a "
"line similar to this (change sdc1 to whatever a usb stick would be on your "
"system) in /etc/fstab:"
msgstr ""
"Para permitir que os(as) usuários(as) montem um pendrive com um sistema de "
"arquivos NTFS nele, coloque uma linha semelhante a esta (mude sdc1 para o "
"que um pendrive seria em seu sistema) em /etc/fstab:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:211
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "/dev/sdc1 /mnt/usb auto user,noauto,umask=0,utf8 0 0"
msgstr "/dev/sdc1 /mnt/usb auto user,noauto,umask=0,utf8 0 0"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:214
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In order for a user to be able to mount the usb stick, they will need to be "
"able to write to <filename class=\"directory\">/mnt/usb</filename>, so as "
"the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para que um(a) usuário(a) possa montar o pendrive, ele(a) precisará ser "
"capaz de escrever em <filename class=\"directory\">/mnt/usb</filename>; "
"portanto, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/ntfs-3g.xml:219
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>chmod -v 777 /mnt/usb</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>chmod -v 777 /mnt/usb</userinput>"

